flf2a$ 3 3 30 -1 6 1 0 126
Font Name: Nessnass Arabic
Font Author: Nessnass
The Arabic letters of the Nessnass font, in single-line Unicode box-drawing characters.
Three rows tall, right to left. Takes Arabic Presentation Forms-B: shape the text first.
https://github.com/nessnass/figlet-font-arabic
MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Nessnass
